*service-account*.json
*service_account*.json
*-credentials.json
*-key.json

# ─── AI / Editor tool configs (personal, not project code) ────────────────────
.claude/
.vscode/

# ─── Git hooks (personal project, no team) ────────────────────────────────────
.husky/

